---
An autumn picnic means kimbap. Five rolls feed four people generously.

## Ingredients (five rolls)

- 4 bowls of rice, 1 tbsp sesame oil, a pinch of salt
- 5 sheets of kimbap seaweed
- 3 eggs, pickled radish, braised burdock
- A bunch of spinach, 1 carrot
- 2 fish cakes (or ham)

## Method

1. Season the rice with sesame oil and salt and let it cool a little
2. Make a thick omelette and cut it into long strips
3. Blanch the spinach and season it with salt and sesame oil
4. Julienne the carrot and stir-fry it briefly
5. Spread a thin layer of rice on the seaweed, add the fillings, roll it tight

> Tip: a drop of sesame oil on the knife keeps the rolls from tearing.

---

Boil the barley tea the night before and the morning is suddenly relaxed.
